{
	"name": "Lucite Slug",
	"type": "object",
	"img": "icons/environment/creatures/bug-worm-pincer-pink.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>These semi-translucent slugs are found both above and below ground, and their presence is marked by the thick trails of shimmering slime they leave in their wakes. This slime is incredibly sticky, and when fresh, can be used as a strong adhesive. Broken or damaged nonmagical items made of wood, bone, or stone may be repaired using lucite slug slime, as in the @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-spells.Item.pblaa5w3f6tuqxuj]{Mending} spell. Adventurers attempting to harvest fresh lucite slug slime or make a repair using the slime with their bare hands must make a DC 12 Dexterity saving throw or their hand becomes adhered to the surface the slime is on for 1 minute.</p>",
